Aug 30 22:09 Cargo.lock\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord    850 Aug 30 22:09 Cargo.toml\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord     64 Aug 30 22:09 .claude\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord    173 Aug 30 22:09 CLAUDE.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord   1688 Aug 30 22:09 clippy.toml\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord   6295 Aug 30 22:09 CONTEXT.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord     84 Aug 30 22:09 docs\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord 153948 Aug 30 22:09 draft.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord    144 Aug 30 22:09 examples\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord     61 Aug 30 22:09 .git\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord     18 Aug 30 22:09 .github\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord    160 Aug 30 22:09 .gitignore\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord   1461 Aug 30 22:09 justfile\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord   1410 Aug 30 22:09 plans\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord    315 Aug 30 22:09 prelude.toy\n-rw-r--r-- 1 kantord kantord   5062 Aug 30 22:09 README.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord   3658 Aug 30 22:09 research-log\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord     18 Aug 30 22:09 runtime\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord    326 Aug 30 22:09 site\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord    350 Aug 30 22:09 src\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 kantord kantord    776 Aug 30 22:09 tests\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"ls -la","time":{"start":1788120589269,"end":1788120589271}},"id":"prt_0544ae357001AtThiYzfepyk4t","sessionID":"ses_fabb535ccffe1uMPqoZsBbW0jp","messageID":"msg_0544ad8f2001ir3AZZUnyqAvnr"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788120589485,"sessionID":"ses_fabb535ccffe1uMPqoZsBbW0jp","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-9e443a6e683abe96","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"gh issue view 145"},"output":"title:\tRuling: Q37 float semantics -- admit NaN/Infinity, division by zero returns Infinity (IEEE)\nstate:\tOPEN\nauthor:\tkantord (Dániel Kántor)\nlabels:\t\ncomments:\t0\nassignees:\t\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nissue-type:\t\nparent:\t\nsub-issues:\t\nsub-issues-completed:\t\nblocked-by:\t\nblocking:\t\nnumber:\t145\n--\nGrilled via float-and-benchmarks.round.yaml, question q37-float-semantics.\n\n**Ruled: admit NaN/Infinity, division by zero returns Infinity, matching IEEE 754** -- overrides the recommended option (forbid NaN/Infinity, raise on zero divisor to match Int). Division stays a total function on Float; Int and Float division now have different failure behavior. Printing format for NaN/Infinity/shortest-roundtrip is still open per-backend conformance work.\n\nNo additional maintainer notes on this question.\n\nUnblocks board row float-build (needs: q37-float-semantics).\n","metadata":{"output":"title:\tRuling: Q37 float semantics -- admit NaN/Infinity, division by zero returns Infinity (IEEE)\nstate:\tOPEN\nauthor:\tkantord (Dániel Kántor)\nlabels:\t\ncomments:\t0\nassignees:\t\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nissue-type:\t\nparent:\t\nsub-issues:\t\nsub-issues-completed:\t\nblocked-by:\t\nblocking:\t\nnumber:\t145\n--\nGrilled via float-and-benchmarks.round.yaml, question q37-float-semantics.\n\n**Ruled: admit NaN/Infinity, division by zero returns Infinity, matching IEEE 754** -- overrides the recommended option (forbid NaN/Infinity, raise on zero divisor to match Int). Division stays a total function on Float; Int and Float division now have different failure behavior. Printing format for NaN/Infinity/shortest-roundtrip is still open per-backend conformance work.\n\nNo additional maintainer notes on this question.\n\nUnblocks board row float-build (needs: q37-float-semantics).\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"gh issue view 145","time":{"start":1788120589466,"end":1788120589468}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me read the key documents: ADR 0007, issue 145, and understand the codebase structure.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_0544ae120001bC3nv9Nlge0txD","sessionID":"ses_fabb535ccffe1uMPqoZsBbW0jp","messageID":"msg_0544ad8f2001ir3AZZUnyqAvnr"}}
